# Luna generation backends
#
# Luna works out of the box with the built-in "Luna Preview" (mock) provider —
# no keys needed. Set any of the below to connect a real open-source backend,
# then pick it in the app via the backend chip in the header.

# --- Replicate (hosted open models: FLUX, SDXL, video, …) --------------------
# Get a token at https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_xxx
# Optional: override the default models (any Replicate model slug).
# REPLICATE_IMAGE_MODEL=black-forest-labs/flux-schnell
# REPLICATE_VIDEO_MODEL=

# --- Claude (AI storyboard drafting) -----------------------------------------
# Powers "Draft with AI". Without it, drafting uses a built-in template.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Voiceover / narration (optional) ----------------------------------------
# Powers per-scene "Voiceover" (text-to-speech), mixed into the export. Without
# it, exports can still use a background-music track. OpenAI's speech endpoint
# is the default backend (Anthropic has no TTS API).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_TTS_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini-tts
# OPENAI_TTS_VOICE=alloy

# --- ComfyUI (self-hosted node-graph engine) ---------------------------------
# URL of your running ComfyUI server.
# COMFYUI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8188
# Path to a saved workflow JSON that the adapter drives (see providers/comfyui.ts).
# COMFYUI_WORKFLOW=./workflows/default.json
